<b>Game Development and Operations Emergency High-Ranking Member Conference</b>

07:37.407 --> 07:40.987
The birth of a legendary class changer 
is a surprising event, right?

07:40.987 --> 07:42.137
That's right.

07:41.467 --> 07:45.947
CEO

07:41.467 --> 07:45.947
<b>Yazaki Isao</b>

07:42.137 --> 07:45.947
I was surprised by the player who went 
to the Eastern Continent earlier, as well.

07:46.287 --> 07:49.167
"The Challenger of the 
Behen Archipelago," yes?

07:46.427 --> 07:50.917
Branch Manager

07:46.427 --> 07:50.917
<b>Shimamura Ryuji</b>

07:49.167 --> 07:52.297
Its difficulty was Ashur-class or higher.

07:51.387 --> 07:55.877
Board Member

07:51.387 --> 07:55.877
<b>Futaba Toshiyuki</b>

07:52.297 --> 07:54.057
He went over to the East,

07:54.057 --> 07:56.607
but the island chain 
itself remains uncleared.

07:56.607 --> 07:58.607
I'm excited to see what happens next.

07:58.607 --> 08:00.367
I have the data here.

07:58.607 --> 07:59.837
Operations Team

07:58.607 --> 07:59.837
<b>Futaba Hinako</b>

08:00.367 --> 08:03.557
Okay. Let's hear your emergency 
investigation report.

08:01.417 --> 08:03.557
S.A. Group Leader & Satisfy Developer

08:01.417 --> 08:03.557
<b>Sakaeda Tetsuhiro</b>

08:03.557 --> 08:04.707
All right.

08:04.707 --> 08:07.817
The player who underwent a 
legendary class change...

08:07.817 --> 08:12.057
His ID is "Grid," and his real 
world name is Nagamine Takumi.

08:12.057 --> 08:14.717
He's a 25-year-old Japanese user.

08:15.247 --> 08:18.287
He was originally a level 73 warrior,

08:18.287 --> 08:20.697
but his current level is -1.

08:21.087 --> 08:24.667
As you can see, he is below 
average in terms of ability

08:24.667 --> 08:26.657
and seems to be nothing special.

08:26.657 --> 08:29.317
It's disappointing for the 
operations team, but...

08:30.327 --> 08:32.997
This legendary class change 
was likely a coincidence.

08:35.007 --> 08:35.917
A coincidence.

08:36.707 --> 08:38.597
Are you sure?

08:40.007 --> 08:44.807
<i>Satisfy</i> already has many 
popular high-ranking players.

08:45.807 --> 08:50.767
For example, Kraugel, the player with 
the highest total rank in the game.

08:51.267 --> 08:55.567
Or Jishuka, the guildmaster 
of the Tzedakah guild,

08:55.567 --> 08:58.557
which is home to many top-ranked 
players and the top-ranked bow user.

08:59.227 --> 09:02.357
They're both very talented, 
but normal class.

09:02.967 --> 09:07.947
Of course, there are those who belong to 
classes ranked higher than normal, but...

09:08.227 --> 09:12.887
Grid has become Pagma's Successor, 
a legendary class of the highest rank,

09:12.887 --> 09:17.367
as if he were sneaking past 
the most popular players.

09:17.747 --> 09:20.457
But Morpheus's prediction was that

09:20.457 --> 09:25.497
Pagma's Tome would be discovered 
two years from now in game time.

09:25.497 --> 09:28.207
We checked for bugs but didn't see any.

09:28.207 --> 09:30.117
The system is operating as it should.

09:30.427 --> 09:34.247
Which means he's gained 
a powerful class and

09:34.247 --> 09:36.817
an advantage in a way we did not expect.

09:38.067 --> 09:39.367
A negative level.

09:40.127 --> 09:43.637
Grid failed the quest the 
minute he changed classes,

09:43.637 --> 09:47.997
making his level -1 
thanks to the failure penalty.

09:48.697 --> 09:52.787
But that was only possible because he 
was undertaking a high-difficulty quest

09:52.787 --> 09:56.637
that normal beginners under level 10 
would never be able to accept.

09:57.427 --> 09:58.457
True.

09:58.457 --> 10:02.117
As of now, he's the only level -1 player.

10:02.427 --> 10:04.257
But what does that mean?

10:04.257 --> 10:05.997
Don't you see?

10:05.997 --> 10:08.267
If he levels up twice 
to get back to level 1,

10:08.267 --> 10:15.477
he'll end up with higher stat points 
than other users of the same level.

10:17.437 --> 10:22.167
Can we assume, despite that, 
that this is all coincidence?

10:31.047 --> 10:34.827
The world's greatest game, my ass.

10:35.147 --> 10:38.027
All my hard work wasted!

10:38.027 --> 10:42.087
I still have to pay the 
lease on this capsule, too!

10:43.267 --> 10:45.587
Bro, you up?

10:47.547 --> 10:50.037
Gaming again?

10:51.987 --> 10:54.857
Don't scare me like that, Seira.

10:54.857 --> 10:57.057
Hey, why don't you clean up for once?

10:58.867 --> 11:01.337
And when's the last 
time you took a shower?

11:01.337 --> 11:04.107
Seira, stop complaining.

11:06.577 --> 11:09.067
Mom and Dad are worried.

11:09.887 --> 11:13.717
Takumi, you need to stop this!

11:13.717 --> 11:16.297
Staying up late every night! If you
have so much time on your hands,

11:16.297 --> 11:17.487
you should help at the shop!

11:17.487 --> 11:20.627
O-Our greengrocer isn't 
so busy it needs help!

11:20.837 --> 11:21.917
No excuses!

11:21.917 --> 11:24.587
Well, it's nice that he's 
working hard at something...

11:24.587 --> 11:25.667
Don't baby him!

11:27.567 --> 11:30.257
I-I think that's enough...

11:30.257 --> 11:32.127
Sheesh.

11:32.827 --> 11:34.727
Dinner's on the table.

11:34.727 --> 11:36.767
We're off to work.

11:36.767 --> 11:40.157
Don't be late for your day job!

11:41.747 --> 11:43.937
<i>Today on </i>Satisfy Every<i>...</i>

11:43.937 --> 11:47.147
<i>Good morning. It's time 
for today's </i>Satisfy Times<i>.</i>

11:44.977 --> 11:49.347
Amazing. This game is really popular.

11:49.347 --> 11:51.657
There are so many channels 
dedicated just to it.

11:49.347 --> 11:54.227
<i></i>Satisfy News<i>! Today, everyone's 
talking about this user!</i>

11:51.657 --> 11:54.517
See? It's possible to 
make huge money off it.

11:55.267 --> 11:58.327
<i>The #5 ranked player in the game...</i>

11:56.367 --> 11:58.327
She's gorgeous...

11:58.327 --> 12:00.497
<i>and the #1 black mage!</i>

12:00.497 --> 12:02.157
That's Yura, the Blood Witch.

12:02.157 --> 12:02.807
<i>Yura!</i>

12:02.807 --> 12:05.097
Yura? The ultra-popular model?

12:05.097 --> 12:07.977
Yup. She's a super-famous user

12:05.707 --> 12:08.427
<i>Her beauty isn't confined to the game.</i>

12:07.977 --> 12:12.637
who got popular in the real world 
because of her in-game activities.

12:08.427 --> 12:09.397
<i>In the real world,</i>

12:09.397 --> 12:13.347
<i>she's also constantly in the spotlight 
in TV shows and on the runway!</i>

12:13.347 --> 12:16.337
She lives in a totally different 
world from you, huh?

12:16.337 --> 12:17.907
Don't say that!

12:19.687 --> 12:21.137
Nagamine-san!

12:20.307 --> 12:23.857
Safety Guaranteed

12:20.307 --> 12:23.857
Human Resources and Onboarding

12:20.307 --> 12:23.857
Matsuhira Dispatch Company

12:21.927 --> 12:23.857
Nagamine Takumi-san!

12:23.857 --> 12:25.417
Y-Yes?

12:25.417 --> 12:26.817
Get over here, quickly.

12:27.077 --> 12:28.637
Good work today.

12:30.377 --> 12:33.987
Physical labor after a full 
night of gaming is rough.

12:33.987 --> 12:37.447
That guy's really addicted to his games.

12:37.447 --> 12:40.217
What? He's useless, then.

12:40.217 --> 12:43.467
Guys like that, they'll screw 
up anything you ask them to do.

12:46.787 --> 12:51.647
Okay. This'll cover my student loans 
and this month's game subscription fee.

12:51.647 --> 12:54.597
As for the extra money 
I spent... next month...

12:55.077 --> 12:58.747
What am I even doing?

13:00.867 --> 13:04.607
<i>No matter what I've done, 
it's never worked out.</i>

13:05.297 --> 13:07.197
<i>When I was in school, I was bullied.</i>

13:08.047 --> 13:10.027
<i>My first crush never 
gave a damn about me.</i>

13:11.257 --> 13:15.457
<i>So I thought that if I worked 
hard in the game and got rich,</i>

13:15.457 --> 13:18.587
<i>I could show them all they were 
wrong about me, at least a little.</i>

13:19.977 --> 13:20.977
<i>But now...</i>

13:21.697 --> 13:23.997
<i>all I do is worry my family.</i>

13:25.727 --> 13:30.667
Maybe I should quit the game and 
try to find something else to do.

13:35.697 --> 13:40.137
But I did get to change 
to a legendary class.

13:40.707 --> 13:44.407
Maybe I can hang in there a little longer!

13:49.767 --> 13:50.937
<i></i>Satisfy<i>!</i>

13:51.607 --> 13:52.507
<i>Ready?</i>

13:52.507 --> 13:53.517
Yes.

13:55.407 --> 13:56.847
<i>Stand by.</i>

13:57.367 --> 14:00.407
