15:15.657 --> 15:17.757
Fill it...

15:15.897 --> 15:19.347
Spirits that sleep in hell!

15:19.347 --> 15:25.117
Fill her with your hatred! 
Manifest the spirits of hell!

15:19.367 --> 15:22.407
Are those... Yatan cultists?

15:23.297 --> 15:25.117
A cursed ritual?

15:25.577 --> 15:27.917
If they find me, they'll kill me.

15:27.917 --> 15:31.227
I need to find an escape teleporter 
and get out of here first.

15:31.227 --> 15:31.877
Hey.

15:35.087 --> 15:36.967
Fill it...

15:37.687 --> 15:38.907
Calm down.

15:37.937 --> 15:40.427
Fill it...

15:40.427 --> 15:44.387
I am Doran, a secret bodyguard 
for Earl Steim's family.

15:44.857 --> 15:46.117
<b>Doran</b>

15:48.807 --> 15:50.217
Irene?

15:50.217 --> 15:51.017
Yes.

15:51.017 --> 15:53.067
Earl Steim's daughter.

15:53.067 --> 15:56.487
She was kidnapped while 
visiting a nearby town.

15:56.847 --> 16:00.167
She is intelligent and kind,
beloved by all.

16:00.167 --> 16:02.957
Everyone's waiting for 
her to be the next ruler.

16:02.957 --> 16:06.217
I'm glad to have someone 
help me rescue her.

16:06.217 --> 16:08.417
Do you mean...

16:08.417 --> 16:09.647
<i>System guidance.</i>

