Good luck!




<b>Time Remaining: 60:00</b>

17:02.147 --> 17:03.687
What?!

17:02.927 --> 17:05.787
Now that you've interrupted the 
ritual, they won't let you escape.

17:05.787 --> 17:08.007
We're stuck with each other now!

17:06.337 --> 17:07.127
Bullshit!

17:07.127 --> 17:09.137
This is bullshit!

17:09.137 --> 17:10.477
Let's go!

17:14.897 --> 17:16.397
Do we have a plan?!

17:16.397 --> 17:18.857
Of course we do! We clear a path!

17:26.327 --> 17:27.607
<i>Wow!</i>

17:27.607 --> 17:30.007
<i>This NPC is super strong!</i>

17:30.567 --> 17:34.217
<i>Maybe he's strong enough that 
we can clear the quest...</i>

17:34.217 --> 17:36.667
<i>What... What can I do?</i>

17:37.847 --> 17:38.547
<i>Support him!</i>

17:39.347 --> 17:40.807
Good luck, Doran!

17:40.807 --> 17:43.857
You're my light! You're my hope!

17:45.047 --> 17:45.797
I get it!

17:46.017 --> 17:48.057
You don't want me to 
fight them one by one.

17:48.057 --> 17:51.167
You had me pause so I could 
slay them all at once!

17:51.167 --> 17:51.767
No, actually...

17:53.107 --> 17:54.597
This will end it!

17:55.437 --> 17:57.147
Diamond Shield.

18:02.007 --> 18:04.517
Fancy seeing you here.

18:05.117 --> 18:08.577
Are you the one who started 
this quest for me?

18:08.577 --> 18:10.027
I'd like to thank you,

18:10.027 --> 18:13.577
but defeating you is the 
clear condition for my quest.

18:14.067 --> 18:15.477
I'll fight you...

18:15.787 --> 18:18.217
I, Yura, the Blood Witch.

18:19.387 --> 18:21.877
My level is 230...

18:22.447 --> 18:24.547
Are you ready?

18:24.547 --> 18:25.787
D-Doran!

18:24.887 --> 18:26.817
There's no time for fear!

18:26.817 --> 18:30.737
He who charges forward will win the day!

18:34.137 --> 18:35.597
You're fast.

18:35.597 --> 18:36.977
Let me slow you down.

18:41.227 --> 18:43.247
Your tricks won't work on me!

18:43.607 --> 18:44.837
Oh?

18:45.217 --> 18:46.197
Then...

18:50.237 --> 18:54.037
If you're not going to back off, 
then this is over.

18:57.127 --> 18:58.077
Doran!

18:58.587 --> 19:01.687
<i>Doran's so strong, and he couldn't win?</i>

19:01.687 --> 19:05.587
<i>Is this the power of the Blood Witch?</i>

19:05.587 --> 19:09.117
Arrogant young black mage...

19:09.117 --> 19:10.617
I'll show you the power

19:10.617 --> 19:13.557
that has defended the earl's 
family for hundreds of years!

19:17.547 --> 19:19.077
What happened?

19:19.477 --> 19:21.287
It's this ring.

19:21.287 --> 19:24.397
It's not perfect, but it will 
block curses and heal me.

19:24.397 --> 19:25.647
Give it to me.

19:25.647 --> 19:28.867
H-How can you possibly ask for that?

19:31.327 --> 19:33.687
They seem like they're 
ready to fight for real.

19:34.287 --> 19:36.497
Nameless adventurer...

19:36.717 --> 19:39.037
I will hold off the enemy.

19:39.037 --> 19:43.207
Rescue my lady... Irene-sama!

19:43.207 --> 19:45.897
No, you can't fight them by yourself.

19:45.897 --> 19:46.997
Someday...

19:47.477 --> 19:49.507
you'll understand.

19:50.367 --> 19:51.467
Here I go!

19:52.287 --> 19:53.867
Oh, damn it all!

20:02.797 --> 20:04.677
Children of Yatan...

20:04.677 --> 20:06.277
Death to the heretic!

20:06.277 --> 20:08.237
How do they respawn so fast?!

20:08.237 --> 20:10.797
Doran, I can't do this!

20:10.797 --> 20:11.407
Oh, no!

20:12.367 --> 20:14.897
You should stay focused during a battle.

20:14.897 --> 20:16.587
This time, you die.

20:16.807 --> 20:18.327
Dark Storm!

20:21.287 --> 20:22.787
<i>I-I'm doomed!</i>

20:52.097 --> 20:54.327
He's still standing?

20:55.187 --> 20:57.177
My HP is... one?

20:57.677 --> 20:58.947
Is this...

20:59.527 --> 21:01.957
<b>Legendary One</b>

20:59.527 --> 21:01.957
<b>Title Bonuses</b>

20:59.527 --> 21:01.957
<b>Resistance to negative status effects</b>

20:59.527 --> 21:01.957
<b>When HP is 1, gain 5 seconds of damage</b>

20:59.527 --> 21:01.957
<b>invulnerability and immortality</b>

20:59.787 --> 21:01.957
the immortality skill my title gives me?

21:02.287 --> 21:04.917
Th-That was a close one!

21:05.517 --> 21:08.667
Who are you?

21:09.987 --> 21:11.377
My name is...

21:13.457 --> 21:14.607
I told you...

21:14.607 --> 21:17.347
He who charges forward wins the day!

21:17.877 --> 21:20.017
Guardian's Shield!

21:20.307 --> 21:22.477
She still has such power?!

21:27.627 --> 21:28.967
He logged out?

21:36.327 --> 21:37.327
<b>You have died</b>

21:36.887 --> 21:40.607
<i>The failure of an S-rank quest has 
caused your level to drop by 2.</i>

21:42.327 --> 21:45.157
<i>Your current player level is -3.</i>

21:45.157 --> 21:47.867
<i>Because you have died twice 
within twenty-four hours,</i>

21:47.867 --> 21:50.257
<i>you will be unable to access 
the game for twelve hours.</i>

21:50.257 --> 21:53.507
That asshole Doran killed 
me when I was on his team!

21:53.507 --> 21:55.967
But it's actually all Yura's fault!

21:56.427 --> 21:59.387
Don't think I'm just some loser!

21:59.567 --> 22:05.357
Nagamine Greengrocers

22:00.157 --> 22:01.287
Takumi!

22:01.287 --> 22:02.617
Do you know what time it is?!

22:01.707 --> 22:03.887
Brother!

22:02.617 --> 22:05.357
Please let me sleep...

22:05.357 --> 22:07.317
Nagamine Greengrocers

22:07.617 --> 22:08.907
<i></i>Satisfy News<i>!</i>

22:08.907 --> 22:12.277
<i>Today, we have a report from our 
in-game journalist, Sumita!</i>

22:12.277 --> 22:16.697
The Ghost of Yatan Temple Appears!

22:12.607 --> 22:13.737
<i>Look at this!</i>

22:13.737 --> 22:17.297
<i>Last night, here at Yatan Temple 
in the north of Eternal Kingdom,</i>

22:17.297 --> 22:19.607
<i>a large-scale collapse occurred!</i>

22:18.367 --> 22:26.377
The Ghost of Yatan Temple Appears!

22:19.607 --> 22:21.517
<i>This happened after an unknown user</i>

22:21.517 --> 22:23.827
<i>blocked an attack from</i>

22:22.877 --> 22:24.467
Is this...

22:23.827 --> 22:27.757
<i>the famous Blood Witch, Yura!</i>

22:27.757 --> 22:29.977
I'm famous!

22:27.757 --> 22:30.187
<i>The whereabouts of this 
mysterious user are unknown,</i>

22:30.187 --> 22:32.607
<i>and we're asking viewers 
to share what they know!</i>

22:32.607 --> 22:37.157
<i>Let's hear what our sole 
witness has to say!</i>

22:35.157 --> 22:37.867
<i>Hello, this is the </i>Satisfy<i> 
</i>News<i> reception desk.</i>

22:37.547 --> 22:40.717
<i>I was being chased by some 
monsters and ended up nearby,</i>

22:37.867 --> 22:39.097
Oh, hello?

22:39.097 --> 22:40.717
I called you after I saw the news!

22:40.717 --> 22:42.997
I'm the mysterious user from Yatan Temple!

22:40.717 --> 22:43.597
<i>and suddenly there was a huge explosion.</i>

22:42.997 --> 22:45.277
<i>Can you give me your player ID?</i>

22:43.597 --> 22:46.837
<i>I saw Yura-san facing 
off with a male player.</i>

22:45.277 --> 22:46.377
"Grid"!

22:46.377 --> 22:47.527
<i>And your level?</i>

22:46.837 --> 22:49.167
<i>Oh, she was really cute!</i>

22:47.527 --> 22:49.167
Minus 3!

22:49.167 --> 22:51.847
<i>Did you see the male user's face?</i>

22:51.227 --> 22:53.997
Damn you, Yura!

22:51.847 --> 22:53.997
<i>No, I was too busy staring at Yura-san!</i>

22:53.997 --> 22:55.477
<i>Not </i>Satisfy<i>!</i>

22:55.477 --> 22:58.027
<i>Th-That's all from the scene!</i>

22:59.707 --> 23:02.287
Doran's dead, right?

23:02.717 --> 23:05.367
He was an NPC, but a good guy.

23:05.787 --> 23:08.237
And that ultra-rare ring he had...

23:08.237 --> 23:11.167
If I had an awesome item 
like that, maybe...

23:11.777 --> 23:15.637
But I couldn't get one easily.

23:15.967 --> 23:17.337
No, that's not right.

23:18.867 --> 23:22.757
Right! I'm the legendary blacksmith!

23:25.777 --> 23:27.897
If I want one, I can make it!

23:28.147 --> 23:30.507
And then I can get stronger,

23:30.507 --> 23:31.857
and make money!

23:32.517 --> 23:35.467
I can say goodbye to my loser life!

23:36.277 --> 23:40.257
<b>Overgeared</b>
